    "title": "Man sentenced for 2021 chase that led to crash, killing Smithville woman - NewsBreak",
    "text": "8 hours ago KANSAS CITY, Mo. — A 35-year-old Kansas City man was sentenced on Wednesday for a 2021 police chase that ended in a crash, killing a 73-year-old Smithville woman. Francois Orloff was sentenced in Jackson County District Court to 15 years in prison for second-degree murder. He entered a guilty plea back in February. All former charges have since been dismissed. Read full article",
